    <p>Every one of these jobs started the same way: a <a href="/sewer-camera-inspection/">sewer camera inspection</a> before anyone quoted a price. What the camera shows decides the method. Pipe that still holds its shape can usually be relined with <a href="/cipp-pipe-lining/">CIPP lining</a>. Pipe that has broken apart but still runs fairly straight is a candidate for <a href="/pipe-bursting/">pipe bursting</a>. Either way, the yard, driveway and landscaping above the line stay in place.</p>
